EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §5.13, §7.6, DECISIONS 312: gen/cpp's types-mode decoder reads every class of the package and refuses a map (nlohmann::json keeps no key order), held by a value or not, a literal-union key or a nested map included; its data loader reads one.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A kind.
enum Kind { a, b }

/// A row.
record Row {
  /// The cells.
  cells: {Kind | "all": Int}
  /// The rows of cells.
  deep: [{String: {Int: String}}] = []
}

emit cpp { out: "@features/a", namespace: "a", mode: types }
